# TypeScript build output
dist/
build/
out/
*.js
*.js.map
*.d.ts
# The above assumes .js files are output in the same directory as .ts files.
# If you specify an output directory in tsconfig.json's outDir,
# specify that directory name instead (e.g., dist/)
# Also, if you want to keep type definition files (.d.ts) under Git control, remove or comment out the *.d.ts line.
# However, since they are typically generated during the build process, they are often ignored.

